# Vite+ Toolchain

This project uses **Vite+** (`vp`) — distinct from raw Vite. Do not use `vite` CLI directly for tooling.

Import config from `vite-plus`, not `vite` (enforced by `vite-plus/prefer-vite-plus-imports` in `vite.config.ts`).

## Commands

- `vp install` — after pull or dependency changes
- `vp check` — format, lint, type-check
- `vp check --fix` — same, applying auto-fixes (also runs on staged files)
- `vp test run` — run tests once
- `vp build` — production build (also via `npm run build`, which copies Sentry instrumentation)
- `vp preview` — preview production build
- `vp run <script>` — run custom `package.json` / vite.config tasks
- `vp env doctor` — diagnose toolchain issues
- `vp help` / `vp <command> --help` — CLI reference

## App scripts (package.json)

Prefer these for app-specific workflows:

- `npm run dev` — dev server (port 3000, `.env.local`, Sentry)
- `npm run build` / `npm run deploy` — production build and Cloudflare deploy
- `npm run db:schema:local|remote` — apply D1 schema
- `npm run db:seed:local|remote` — generate and load seed

## Before finishing work

```bash
vp check
vp test run
```

Docs: `node_modules/vite-plus/docs` or https://viteplus.dev/guide/
